/T (The CircuitQuest included four circuits to be designed by the contestants, followed by a Google Meet session where they had to explain the designs to the judge panel. The circuit design competition aimed to test students' conception of electrical components, circuitry and problem-solving skills. The CircuitQuest was an incredible opportunity for the students to try out their skills. The esteemed judge panel evaluated the practicality, creativity and efficiency of the designs. Debojit Sarkar, a first-year student from the CSE department, claimed the title of champion, while Chayan Barman  , a first-year student  from the Mechanical department, secured the runner-up position. )
